    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Michael Pigott Auctioneer & Valuer proudly brings to the market this stunning modern detached residence set on a generous 0.37-acre site, just 3 miles from Carrigaline and approximately 20–25 minutes from Cork City Centre, offering the perfect balance of peaceful countryside living and excellent accessibility.\r\n\r\nBeautifully designed with contemporary family living in mind, the home is flooded with natural light through extensive glazing, creating bright, airy interiors throughout. At the heart of the property is a stunning open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, providing an ideal space for both everyday family life and entertaining.\r\n\r\nOutside, the private south-facing rear garden is a standout feature, enjoying sunshine throughout the day and offering a beautifully appointed patio complete with outdoor lighting—perfect for al fresco dining or relaxing with family and friends. A chipped stone driveway enhances the property's impressive kerb appeal while providing ample parking.\r\nExceptional comfort and energy efficiency are ensured by a geothermal heating system with underfloor heating on both the ground and first floors, delivering a warm, comfortable living environment all year round.\r\n\r\nCombining stylish contemporary design, generous accommodation, premium finishes and an enviable location, this outstanding home presents a rare opportunity to acquire a superb family residence within easy reach of Carrigaline, Cork City and a host of local amenities.\r\n\r\nViewing of this truly exceptional home truly needs to be seen to fully appreciate its appeal."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": ""
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Size: 250 sq metres (2,697 sq ft)\r\nPrivate 0.37 acre site with south facing rear garden\r\nBuilt to the highest of specifications with standout features and extras evident\r\nExtensive modern fitted kitchen with integrated appliances & centre island\r\nStunning patio area with outdoor lighting \r\nGeothermal underfloor heating throughout both floors\r\n5 minutes drive to Carrigaline\r\nEasy commute to Cork City Centre & Cork Airport"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: A3"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "On entering Carrigaline via the Shannon Park roundabout, continue straight through the next two roundabouts. Go straight ahead on the main street and follow the road as it curves to the right, past ‘The Corner House’. Continue on straight out the Lower Kilmoney road, driving for approximately 3/4 km and take the 1st turn to the left. Follow this road and keep right at the next T-junction. The property is situated along here on the right hand side, indicated by our ‘For Sale’ Sign. Follow Eircode: P43 FT63"
      }
